;    0: TWdLink(count=2437, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I had a feeling he knew something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am by no means uninvolved, either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So today, I am going to find out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There will be an attendant present, I suppose, but being overheard hardly matters at this point.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
A thick acrylic panel, like the ones you see on TV.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the other side of it is my family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today, I have to ask this family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What happened back then, and what is about to happen now.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. It's been a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>"Mm... I brought you some things."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>Dad</STYLE> kept his head down the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His eyes were vacant, not quite focused on anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
His body swayed slowly back and forth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That, probably, is how a drug addict behaves.<PG>
I had heard from <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>'s lawyer that his behavior was getting stranger by the day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether it was stress from being arrested or a mental illness was not clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From what I had heard, <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> had used Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I had expected a reaction like a stimulant drug's to show up, but―<PG>
However, according to the test results, nothing of the kind was detected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand. This is being covered up, blatantly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> using Droga is, officially, an extremely awkward matter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The incident in Arata where a great many people were arrested―the fact that it has not been reported says as much, too.<PG>
So I was surprised that a visit like this was allowed today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a condition attached, though.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No talking about the incident―that was the condition for the visit the lawyer passed on to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It depended, too, on how the attendant sitting in would judge things, but there was no telling how much information I could draw out of <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> passed away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... A heart attack..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
Even on hearing of his <STYLE ID="3">mother</STYLE>'s death, he went on swaying back and forth as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He seemed somewhat surprised, but did not look as if it had really sunk in.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... And... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> died too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\幸太郎うつろ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\面会室アクリル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this time, he showed blatant surprise.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The swaying stopped, and he looked up with a start.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"How..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> did it..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\幸太郎貼りつき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物1,000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Why!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Why!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, stop that! I'll end the visit!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At once the attendant took hold of <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> and stopped him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, little by little, the strength drained from <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>'s body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\幸太郎うつろ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
And once again, he sank limply into the chair.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... did... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, this time he clawed furiously at his head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I thought, <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> knows.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why <STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE> stabbed <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> to death.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s been unconscious ever since, from the shock."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Damn...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging by the attendant's reaction, he seemed interested in what we were saying, but showed no sign of stopping the visit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He has been told we must not talk about the incident, but he probably cannot tell that <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>'s death has anything to do with that incident.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, don't you know something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">Damn...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "10" "10" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">　You monster...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　You monster...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hey, you okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The attendant put a hand on <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>'s back and spoke to him.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> went on muttering to himself, too low to make out, and began swaying again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\幸太郎うつろ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\面会室アクリル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Eventually, when <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>'s swaying stopped, the attendant quietly stepped away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Five minutes left,"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
he announced.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, do you know something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Falsificaso... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">use it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right, that's it. Visiting time is over."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Please wait! It hasn't been five minutes yet!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We're done for today. Come on, on your feet."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... No..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The attendant ignored me and tried to take hold of <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\幸太郎貼りつき大.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物1,000" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "500" "30"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">! Kill the goddess!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPS>　Th-th-the goddess...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6"><TXSPN>　Agagaga...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Praise her...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Stop it, <STYLE ID="2">Niimura</STYLE>! Get back!"<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">"The goddess is a great being!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Praise her!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Kill!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Kill them all!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Kill the goddess!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="6">　Praise her!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Then the door on my side opened, and two more attendants came in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"That's the end. Please leave the room."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... But!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If you keep this up, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> will be taken into custody."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>, I too was seized and dragged out of the room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\面会室.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was done in by the goddess's plan!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">　Kill!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">　Praise her!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">　The Goddess is great...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>'s shouts came through the door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya Niimura-san</STYLE>, please never speak of what happened today. This is an order from the National Police Agency."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... The National Police Agency...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But I got no answer at all, and was thrown straight out of the detention center.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE> trying to say?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is the Goddess?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I... What can I do?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\東京.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ループ東京.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was a time I did not want.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Days passed after I saw <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>, then months.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Arata settlement was closed, and I lost my hometown.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Shirozaki-san went to stay with a friend in Iizawa City, and <STYLE ID="11">Kana</STYLE> was left in <STYLE ID="12">Auntie</STYLE>'s care.<PG>
I go on living in Tokyo as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For some reason, the state suddenly granted me a generous scholarship.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I go to university, work part-time, go to mixers too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I have no choice but to live this way.<PG>
I grew up in Arata.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I am sensitive to the presence of people and animals.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If someone is watching me, I can tell right away, even when an ordinary person could not.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Yes, ever since I saw <STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE>, I have been watched the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
